# PC card pc-team-tight (BENCH-275): the pilot, tp on the five TIGHT teams, 4 seeds from 31000, 12 rounds, against master (the aa build). Template: the card's prep writes the work copy with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
--team
true
--seeds
4
--seed-base
31000
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
plans/team-tight-set.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@tp.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@tp
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-tight-@V@-pep
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-tight-pep.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
